/original/aa.jpg alt=/haber/yemekhane-eyleminde-ogrencileri-coplayan-polise-uzaklastirma-218216 loading=lazy></div></a><div class=hline--1x></div><a href=/haber/istanbul-universitesi-rektorlugu-yemekhane-kararini-iptal-etti-218126 class="ccard ccard--news ccard--news-small"><div class=txt-wrapper><h5 class=headline>&#x130;stanbul &#xDC;niversitesi Rekt&#xF6;rl&#xFC;&#x11F;&#xFC; Yemekhane Karar&#x131;n&#x131; &#x130;ptal Etti</h5><div class=date>6 Ocak 2020</div></div><div class=img-wrapper><img src=https://static.bianet.org/system/uploads/1/articles/main_image/000/218/126/original/qq.jpg alt=/haber/istanbul-universitesi-rektorlugu-yemekhane-kararini-iptal-etti-218126 loading=lazy></div></a><div class=hline--1x></div><a href=/haber/rektorun-kutlamalarina-butce-var-ogrencinin-yemegine-yok-218078 class="ccard ccard--news ccard--news-small"><div class=txt-wrapper><h6 class=surheadline>&#x130;&#xDC; &#xD6;&#x11E;RENC&#x130;LER&#x130; Y&#x130;NE EYLEMDE:</h6><h5 class=headline>&quot;Rekt&#xF6;r&#xFC;n Kutlamalar&#x131;na B&#xFC;t&#xE7;e Var; &#xD6;&#x11F;rencinin Yeme&#x11F;ine Yok&quot;</h5><div class=date>3 Ocak 2020</div></div><div class=img-wrapper><img src=https://static.bianet.org/system/uploads/1/articles/main_image/000/218/078/original/İÜ-M-132.jpg alt=/haber/rektorun-kutlamalarina-butce-var-ogrencinin-yemegine-yok-218078 loading=lazy></div></a><div class=hline--1x></div><a href=/haber/iu-de-ogrencilerin-yemek-protestosuna-polis-saldirisi-218014 class="ccard ccard--news ccard--news-small"><div class=txt-wrapper><h5 class=headline>&#x130;&#xDC;&#x27;de &#xD6;&#x11F;rencilerin Yemek Protestosuna Polis Sald&#x131;r&#x131;s&#x131;</h5><div class=date>2 Ocak 2020</div></div><div class=img-wrapper><img src=https://static.bianet.org/system/uploads/1/articles/main_image/000/218/014/original/İÜ_yeni-132.jpg alt=/haber/iu-de-ogrencilerin-yemek-protestosuna-polis-saldirisi-218014 loading=lazy></div></a></div></div></div></section><div class=most-read-contents-mobile></div><